# Base URL of the deployed fold-commons-backend Cloudflare Worker (see
# backend/). Used for both the photo library (GET /photos) and the
# community gallery (GET/POST /gallery). Leave unset to run with only the
# bundled photos/manifest.json set and a localStorage-only gallery — that's
# the default and requires no backend at all.
# VITE_FOLD_API=https://fold-commons-backend.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev
